higher than the price. Also the 6xxx Machines are HUGE, HEAVVY and requre 
3 phase outlets and a clima control. A 6310 draws about 6A/360V without 
any drives. Also, most RA drives require 3 case outlets and usually are 
connected to a HSC. This drives are NOT designed to run at home!

