The PMAG-B is your frame buffer (I think it's an 1024x768 256 color video
board). This is where you want to plug in your monitor cable. How have you
connected your monitor cable? My monitor cable has three BNC's in the
monitor end and one, three pin, rather wide connector in the other end that
plugs into my PMAG-FA on the Decstation.


