Sender: news@cwi.nl (The Daily Dross)
References: <y64t6gs45q.fsf@tweedledumb.cygnus.com> <EI8B8I.DIA@cwi.nl> <62eqtu$2ua$1@goanna.cs.rmit.edu.au>
