I am using a dual 200MHz cpu Alpha 2100 for development running Oracle, and
quad 275MHz Alpha 2100 for production, and the dual+ cpu configurations
make a lot better than 1 cpu when you have client-server and a lot of
users.

The 200MHz cpu modules are dirt cheap these days, but the 275MHz will give
you a lot more performance improvement due to 4MB cache vs 1MB on 200.

