Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec


To avoid being in single user while dumping you can use 
the Advfs clone fileset facility:

1) 	clonefset domain fset clonefset
2)	mount -t advfs domain#clonefset /mnt
3)	vdump -0u /mnt
4)	umount /mnt
5)	rmfset -f domain clonefset

In this way the changes to files belonging to fset are not
reported on the dump which is frozen at the status it was when
cloned.




