:of monitor it will require. Is this an X-term and can I use one of my many 
:VR260 or VR262 monitors with it?

  The VT1200 is an X terminal.  Yes, this terminal *should* be compatible
  with the common VR260- and VR290-class video monitors -- it was usually
  sold with the higher-resolution VR300-series monitors, however.  The
  VT1200 uses ROM-based code.  (The VXT series terminals used downloaded
  software -- various of the VT1xxx series termianls were upgraded to VXT
  series terminals.)

