>
>-> It's very simple.  If BillGate$Inc has his way, there will not BE any
>-> competing products, period.  BGInc. wants world domination of the
>-> computer business, period.  NCSA Mosaic is gone; when Netscape is gone
>-> as well what choice will I have for a browser? NONE.  BG will have
