science into a religion." An ad hominen attack that does not represent
at all what Richard has said. He has not advocated any one language as
being uniformly better than another, he has avoided attributing
disagreements to a general lack of knowledge or expertise, he has not
said that Fortran is a great language (just that Fortran 90 is
significantly better than Fortran 77 and in many aspects a more modern
