wither, it could be worth intervening someday.  I would not in advance
eliminate that possibility forever, independent to how the real world
truly turns out.

If it's not too late.

Let's see how it goes.  We can do out tiny bit by choosing the
alternatives, currently.  Not in order to "sink" MS, just to help keep
them on their toes.  But this may or may not be enough to keep them from
eventually getting out of hand.
    Zhahai




