This is the procedure Oracle support and myself use:

 * Oracle
    - make a self-extracting VMS executable (.EXE) with the patch (.BCK) as 
      input
    - FTP this .EXE in binary mode to their (UNIX) mail-system 
      (WITHOUT uuencoding it first!)
    - mail it as binary ATTACHMENT to me

 * myself
    - extract the mail to a file
    - use MUNPACK to unpack the file into an .EXE (the mail is MIME encoded)
    - run the .EXE, wich recreates the file patch.BCK


