Gates could do no such things.

In a truly free society, what goes into/over/through your property
must leave it unchange. I.e. extended riparian rights.

This for example, no air pollution.

All "normally unowned property" (the sun, air, ...) will be owned
property of the Government (note - this is NOT the State, see below).





    PROPERTY - Your life, your intangibles (ideas etc.), your
    tangible derivatives (things you've produced or bought etc.).

    MORAL - Any act between two or more adults that is voluntary
    and mutually agreed upon and involves only PROPERTY owned by
    the parties involved.

    FREEDOM - The societal condition that exists when all
    exchanges of PROPERTY are MORAL.

    PROFIT - An increase in happiness brough about by a MORAL
    exchange of PROPERTY.

    UCO (UNIVERSAL CAN OPENER) - The question "Whose PROPERTY is
    it?".

    INITIATION OF COERCION (IOC) - The use of force, threat of force,
    or fraud in forcing an exchange of property that is
    involuntary and/or not mutually agreed upon.

    COERCION - The use of force, or threat of force, to create
    compliance to a set of behaviour.

    STATE - A coercive system that rules and coerces the people
    living under it in order to provide the "sick pleasure"
    of controlling others to a select few.

    GOVERNMENT - A societal system that institues FREEDOM, or
    an exceptionally high degree of it (99.9% of all acts that
    exchange PROPERTY).

