:>You're the CTO of a very successful ISP, and if I recall correctly Best.net 
:>is running FreeBSD on all of your servers. (Or have you switched to BSDI?)  
:>Care to give us a quick run-down on why you're not on the NT bandwagon?
:>
:>-jcr
