Kevin Landry wrote:
> 
> I am trying to eliminate the "Username>" and "Local>" prompts.  I would
> like to have all terminal servers go directly to the "Username:" prompt
> on our one and only Alpha System.   I am running OpenVMS v7.1.

The 90M and 900tm use different commands, but the gist is to define a
dedicated service.  I can't remember offhand how to do that on the 90m,
but on the 900tm it's like this:

Local> SET PRIV
Password> (enter priv password)
Local> CHANGE PORT x DEDICATED SERVICE blah

"x" can be a single port, or a range: i.e. 1-5.

