bhp 40 lb/ft^2 torque engine that gets about 10 mpg?
And don't forget, as unrealistic as this may seem today, just think of how
unrealistic it would have sounded 20 years ago if it was announced that
mediocre products would completely dominate the computer market in 20
years?

