I am looking for a free or inexpensive VAX.  I have an
ALPHAstation 255/233 (with (currently) 64 MB RAM and 3 GB
disk), and no VAX can compete as far as speed goes, so
obviously I don't need the VAX for speed.  Although I worked
on a VAXstation 3100 M76 for years and REALLY like the
